      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7e9207eca9001d631b9aca44750ac121a12173bb.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/7e9207eca9001d631b9aca44750ac121a12173bb\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e9207eca9001d631b9aca44750ac121a12173bb_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"i3H1VKZtEFeHh0J1rnRh2ZLclHd\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e9207eca9001d631b9aca44750ac121a12173bb_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e9207eca9001d631b9aca44750ac121a12173bb_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e9207eca9001d631b9aca44750ac121a12173bb_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e9207eca9001d631b9aca44750ac121a12173bb_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 103 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>This whole game felt like I should be waiting to play my cards at just the right time to gain ALL the favours, but it was enough to simply take out all the gladiators and beat down on Kaarga with whatever was on hand. The environment was a null factor since games in the arena go by too fast for the Celestial Tribunal to set up.</p>",
