      "created_at": "2022-12-30T17:44:39.299Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Probably not going to make it back to my desktop to play this one for a Mint unless I can squeeze it in the final hours on Monday. I’m afraid installing Steam on my work laptop to play Sentinels is a dicey proposition. I did however feel the need to point out that the victory screen looks like Kaargra is impaled by the sword that is the Celestial Tribunal ship. Try to unsee that now! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/astonished.png?v=12\" title=\":astonished:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":astonished:\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/dagger.png?v=12\" title=\":dagger:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":dagger:\"></p>",
