      "created_at": "2023-01-02T21:31:17.432Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/be06241b34acd689c768e880aef9dd22022de6f3.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/be06241b34acd689c768e880aef9dd22022de6f3\" title=\"20230102162448_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/be06241b34acd689c768e880aef9dd22022de6f3_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20230102162448_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"r71SlheunDzeXf7aRKpnHsV5tOX\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/be06241b34acd689c768e880aef9dd22022de6f3_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/be06241b34acd689c768e880aef9dd22022de6f3_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/be06241b34acd689c768e880aef9dd22022de6f3_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"484F3F\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20230102162448_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 406 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Well, I got it in time but the sword alignment is somewhat off on a desktop screenshot.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The_Justifier\" data-post=\"8\" data-topic=\"29800\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/48/4954_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> The_Justifier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It’s even better if you imagine she really is impaled by a sword of that size (in picture, not in lore)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Or one can imagine that the Tribunal is to normal scale and this is the alt-universe Kaargra from Giant World! She just scoffs at “huge” Sky-Scraper from the normal universe.</p>",
